  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suriname Agriculture Market Access Project (SAMAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Suriname Agriculture Market Access Project (SAMAP) will enhance sustainable agricultural development, for inclusive growth and employment. The main impact indicator is to increase the level of assets/income of targeted smallholders by at least 15% in real terms. 
SAMAP specific objective aims at increased, more competitive and safer production of selected crops through an enabling environment and enhanced capacities of private sector and institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
